        "Background": "Ai awoke in an alley with no memory of who she was. As she wandered Tokyo trying to survive, she discovered she could sense others' thoughts and emotions, and even move objects with her mind. Worse, she found herself doggedly pursued by strange, unsettling men in black suits.",
